{"name":"Fallow","hex":"#c19a51","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"fallow","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Ground ploughed and harrowed but left unseeded for one year.","Uncultivated land."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Ploughed but left unseeded for more than one planting season.","Left unworked and uncropped for some amount of time."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/fallow"}],"entries":[{"title":"Fallow","blocks":[{"text":"Fallow is a farming technique in which arable land is left without sowing for one or more vegetative cycles. The goal of fallowing is to allow the land to recover and store organic matter while retaining moisture and disrupting pest life cycles and soil-borne pathogens by temporarily removing their hosts. Crop rotation systems typically called for some of a farmer's fields to be left fallow each year."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/Fallow_field_by_Coldharbour_Lane_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1309079.jpg/330px-Fallow_field_by_Coldharbour_Lane_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1309079.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fallow"},{"title":"Fallow (restaurant)","blocks":[{"text":"Fallow is a restaurant located in London, England. The restaurant serves modern British cuisine, with an emphasis on sustainable cooking. It has been listed as a Bib Gourmand restaurant in the Michelin Guide since 2021."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/Fallow_entrance.jpg/330px-Fallow_entrance.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fallow_(restaurant)"},{"title":"Fallow (color)","blocks":[{"text":"Fallow is a pale brown color that is the color of withered foliage or sandy soil in fallow fields. This however is a post factum rationalization, and the etymologies are distinct."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Fallow_Deer_%28Dama_dama%29.jpg/330px-Fallow_Deer_%28Dama_dama%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fallow_(color)"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"fallow":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7d/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-fallow.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7d/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-fallow.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-fallow.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7d/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-fallow.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-fallow.wav.ogg"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"2025.07.13 Fallow Deer (Dama dama) Čyrvony Bor Landscape Reserve Viciebsk Region Belarus 01","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/2025.07.13_Fallow_Deer_%28Dama_dama%29_%C4%8Cyrvony_Bor_Landscape_Reserve_Viciebsk_Region_Belarus_01.jpg/500px-2025.07.13_Fallow_Deer_%28Dama_dama%29_%C4%8Cyrvony_Bor_Landscape_Reserve_Viciebsk_Region_Belarus_01.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2025.07.13_Fallow_Deer_(Dama_dama)_%C4%8Cyrvony_Bor_Landscape_Reserve_Viciebsk_Region_Belarus_01.jpg","share":0.24},{"title":"Sèvres - Magot - Pajou, buste de Madame du Barry 08","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/S%C3%A8vres_-_Magot_-_Pajou%2C_buste_de_Madame_du_Barry_08.jpg/500px-S%C3%A8vres_-_Magot_-_Pajou%2C_buste_de_Madame_du_Barry_08.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:S%C3%A8vres_-_Magot_-_Pajou,_buste_de_Madame_du_Barry_08.jpg","share":0.215625},{"title":"Damhirsche (Dama dama) im Oranjezon (Oostkapelle, Walcheren, Niederlande) 03","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/Damhirsche_%28Dama_dama%29_im_Oranjezon_%28Oostka